                  "type": "markdown",
                  "content": "{#- Maxi 2026-11-03: next STM buses near home that reach a metro station (GTFS Realtime entry\n    \"STM\", sensor.stm_<stop>_arrival_1..3). Polling is off: the feed refreshes when a tablet opens a bus page and every\n    minute while one shows it (or party mode is on), so data older than 3 minutes shows as \"updating\".\n    One row per stop/direction: stop, usual route, metro station it reaches, metro line colour, walk in minutes\n    (street grid, 80 m/min), corner, the stop's arrival sensors. Buses that leave before you can walk there are\n    skipped. Each row links to that stop's map, tablets-subviews/subview-bus-<stop>. -#}\n{%- set dirs = [\n  ['52457', '10', 'Papineau', '00B300', 1, 'De Lorimier / Marie-Anne'],\n  ['52381', '97', 'Mont-Royal', 'D95700', 3, 'du Mont-Royal / De Lorimier'],\n  ['52383', '97', 'Pie-IX', '00B300', 3, 'du Mont-Royal / De Lorimier'],\n  ['52389', '45', 'Papineau', '00B300', 5, 'Papineau / Marie-Anne'],\n  ['52388', '45', 'Fabre', '0095E6', 5, 'Papineau / Marie-Anne'],\n  ['52564', '29', 'Préfontaine', '00B300', 5, 'Rachel / De Lorimier'],\n] -%}\n{%- set route_colors = {'10': '009EE0', '29': '009EE0', '45': '781B7D', '97': '781B7D'} -%}\n{%- set ns = namespace(asof=none, rows=[]) -%}\n{%- for stop, route, metro, line, walk, corner in dirs -%}\n  {%- for i in [1, 2, 3] -%}\n    {%- set s = states['sensor.stm_' ~ stop ~ '_arrival_' ~ i] -%}\n    {%- if s and (ns.asof is none or s.last_reported > ns.asof) -%}{%- set ns.asof = s.last_reported -%}{%- endif -%}\n  {%- endfor -%}\n{%- endfor -%}\n{%- set fresh = ns.asof is not none and (now() - ns.asof).total_seconds() < 180 -%}\n{%- for stop, route, metro, line, walk, corner in dirs -%}\n  {%- set d = namespace(list=[], any=false) -%}\n  {%- for i in [1, 2, 3] -%}\n    {%- set e = 'sensor.stm_' ~ stop ~ '_arrival_' ~ i -%}\n    {%- set m = states(e) | float(-1) -%}\n    {%- if m >= 0 -%}{%- set d.any = true -%}{%- endif -%}\n    {%- if m >= walk -%}\n      {%- set d.list = d.list + [[m | int, state_attr(e, 'route_id') | string, state_attr(e, 'route_color') or route_colors.get(route, '009EE0'),\n        state_attr(e, 'location_source') == 'vehicle_position_message']] -%}\n    {%- endif -%}\n  {%- endfor -%}\n  {%- set first = d.list[0] if fresh and d.list else [none, route, route_colors.get(route, '009EE0'), false] -%}\n  {%- set station = 'Frontenac' if stop == '52383' and first[1] == '368' else metro -%}\n  {%- set pin = '<ha-icon icon=\"mdi:map-marker\"></ha-icon>' -%}\n  {%- if not fresh -%}\n    {%- set times = '<b>…</b><i>updating</i>' -%}\n  {%- elif d.list -%}\n    {%- set then = namespace(s='') -%}\n    {%- for x in d.list[1:] -%}\n      {%- set then.s = then.s ~ (' · ' if not loop.first else '') ~ (pin if x[3] else '') ~ ('<small>' ~ x[1] ~ '</small> ' if x[1] != first[1] else '') ~ x[0] -%}\n    {%- endfor -%}\n    {%- set leave = first[0] - walk -%}\n    {%- set times = '<b>' ~ (pin if first[3] else '') ~ first[0] ~ '<small> min</small></b>'\n      ~ ('<i>then ' ~ then.s ~ '</i>' if then.s else '')\n      ~ '<strong>' ~ ('leave now' if leave < 1 else 'leave in ' ~ leave ~ ' min') ~ '</strong>' -%}\n  {%- else -%}\n    {%- set times = '<b>—</b><i>' ~ ('none you can catch' if d.any else 'no bus coming') ~ '</i>' -%}\n  {%- endif -%}\n  {%- set a = '<a href=\"/tablets-subviews/subview-bus-' ~ stop ~ '?kiosk\">' -%}\n  {%- set ns.rows = ns.rows + ['<tr><td>' ~ a ~ '<font color=\"#' ~ first[2] ~ '\"><b>' ~ first[1] ~ '</b></font></a></td>'\n    ~ '<td>' ~ a ~ '<b><font color=\"#' ~ line ~ '\">●</font> ' ~ station ~ '</b><i><ha-icon icon=\"mdi:bus-stop\"></ha-icon>' ~ corner ~ '</i>'\n    ~ '<i><ha-icon icon=\"mdi:walk\"></ha-icon>' ~ walk ~ ' min walk</i></a></td>'\n    ~ '<td>' ~ a ~ times ~ '</a></td></tr>'] -%}\n{%- endfor -%}\n<table>\n<tr><th colspan=\"3\"><small><ha-icon icon=\"mdi:gesture-tap\"></ha-icon>{{ 'tap a bus for its map · as of ' ~ as_local(ns.asof).strftime('%H:%M') if fresh else 'updating' ~ (' · last data ' ~ as_local(ns.asof).strftime('%H:%M') if ns.asof else '') }}</small><ha-icon icon=\"mdi:bus\"></ha-icon>Next buses to the metro</th></tr>\n{{ ns.rows | join('\\n') }}\n</table>",
                  "card_mod": {
                    "style": {
                      ".": "/* Maxi 2026-11-03: next buses page (top menu Bus key); rows are flat keys like the menu (the tray colour, 30% darker) */\nha-card {\n  padding: 0 12px !important;\n  --bus-key-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);\n  --bus-key-pressed-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.45);\n}\nha-markdown {\n  padding: 0 !important;\n}\n",
                      "ha-markdown$": "/* the 6 rows share 100vh - 218px (content ends above the Home button); line boxes are px so the Kiosk text zoom\n   (0.8 hallway/workshop, 1.1 kitchen) only changes the glyphs */\ntable {\n  width: 100%;\n  border-collapse: separate !important;\n  border-spacing: 0 8px !important;\n  margin: 0 !important;\n}\nth {\n  border: none !important;\n  padding: 0 6px !important;\n  height: 36px;\n  font-size: 24px;\n  line-height: 36px;\n  font-weight: 500;\n  text-align: left;\n  white-space: nowrap;\n}\nth small {\n  float: right;\n  font-size: 16px;\n  font-weight: 400;\n  opacity: 0.6;\n}\ntd {\n  border: none !important;\n  padding: 0 !important;\n  background: var(--bus-key-color);\n  vertical-align: middle;\n}\ntr:active > td {\n  background: var(--bus-key-pressed-color);\n}\ntd:first-child {\n  width: 1%;\n  border-radius: 10px 0 0 10px;\n}\ntd:last-child {\n  width: 1%;\n  border-radius: 0 10px 10px 0;\n}\na {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  justify-content: center;\n  box-sizing: border-box;\n  height: calc((100vh - 218px) / 6);\n  overflow: hidden;\n  color: inherit !important;\n  text-decoration: none !important;\n  -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;\n}\ntd:nth-child(1) > a {\n  align-items: center;\n  padding: 0 14px 0 16px;\n}\ntd:nth-child(1) font {\n  display: inline-block;\n  min-width: 64px;\n  padding: 6px 10px;\n  border-radius: 12px;\n  background: currentColor;\n  text-align: center;\n  font-size: 38px;\n  line-height: 46px;\n}\ntd:nth-child(1) font > b {\n  color: #fff;\n}\ntd:nth-child(2) > a {\n  align-items: flex-start;\n  padding: 0 8px;\n}\ntd:nth-child(2) b {\n  font-size: 32px;\n  line-height: 42px;\n  font-weight: 500;\n  white-space: nowrap;\n}\ntd:nth-child(2) i {\n  font-style: normal;\n  font-size: 19px;\n  line-height: 26px;\n  opacity: 0.7;\n}\ntd:nth-child(3) > a {\n  align-items: flex-end;\n  padding: 0 18px 0 8px;\n  white-space: nowrap;\n}\ntd:nth-child(3) b {\n  font-size: 56px;\n  line-height: 62px;\n  font-weight: 700;\n}\ntd:nth-child(3) b small {\n  font-size: 22px;\n  font-weight: 400;\n  opacity: 0.7;\n}\ntd:nth-child(3) i {\n  font-style: normal;\n  font-size: 22px;\n  line-height: 28px;\n  opacity: 0.75;\n}\ntd:nth-child(3) i small {\n  font-size: 16px;\n}\ntd:nth-child(3) strong {\n  font-size: 20px;\n  line-height: 26px;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  color: var(--primary-color);\n}\nha-icon {\n  --mdc-icon-size: 19px;\n  display: inline-block;\n  height: 19px;\n  line-height: 19px;\n  vertical-align: -2px;\n  margin-right: 4px;\n}\nth ha-icon {\n  --mdc-icon-size: 26px;\n  height: 26px;\n  line-height: 26px;\n  margin-right: 8px;\n  vertical-align: -5px;\n}\nth small ha-icon {\n  --mdc-icon-size: 16px;\n  height: 16px;\n  line-height: 16px;\n  margin-right: 4px;\n  vertical-align: -2px;\n}\ntd:nth-child(3) ha-icon {\n  color: var(--primary-color);\n}\ntd:nth-child(3) b ha-icon {\n  --mdc-icon-size: 34px;\n  height: 34px;\n  line-height: 34px;\n  vertical-align: 3px;\n}\n"
                    }
                  }
                },
                {
                  "type": "custom:navbar-card",
                  "haptic": {
                    "url": false,
                    "tap_action": true,
                    "hold_action": true,
                    "double_tap_action": true
                  },
                  "desktop": {
                    "position": "bottom",
                    "show_labels": true
                  },
                  "mobile": {
                    "show_labels": false,
                    "mode": "floating",
                    "position": "top"
                  },
                  "routes": [
                    {
                      "url": false,
                      "icon": "mdi:arrow-collapse-left",
                      "label": "Home",
                      "tap_action": {
                        "action": "navigate-back"
                      }
                    }
                  ],
                  "styles": "/* 1. Anchor the parent wrapper at the bottom centre of the screen, 15px up (Maxi 2026-10-29) */\n.navbar {\n  position: fixed !important;\n  bottom: 15px !important;\n  right: auto !important;\n  left: 50% !important;\n  width: auto !important;\n  transform: translateX(-50%) !important;\n  overflow: visible !important;\n}\n\n/* 2. Format the navbar block shape. Maxi 2026-10-29: \"The home button is hard to read\": the theme's main colour\n   with a near-black, bold icon and label (4.8:1 to 6.3:1 contrast on synthwave, redwave and the app's pink) */\n.navbar-card {\n  position: relative !important;\n  overflow: visible !important;\n  background-color: var(--primary-color) !important;\n  border: 1px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35) !important;\n  border-radius: 12px !important;\n  padding: 4px !important;\n}\n.navbar-card .button {\n  color: #111 !important;\n  --icon-primary-color: #111;\n}\n.navbar-card ha-icon {\n  color: #111 !important;\n}\n.navbar-card .label {\n  color: #111 !important;\n  font-size: 13px !important;\n  font-weight: 700 !important;\n}\n\n/* 3. Glowing ping in the theme's main colour. Maxi 2026-10-26: compositor-only (transform + opacity on a halo behind the\n   button); the old animated box-shadow restyled and repainted the page every frame, forever (slow on the kitchen tablet) */\n.navbar-card::after {\n  content: \"\";\n  position: absolute;\n  inset: -1px;\n  border-radius: 12px;\n  background: var(--primary-color);\n  z-index: -1;\n  pointer-events: none;\n  will-change: transform, opacity;\n  animation: ping-halo 1.7s infinite;\n}\n@keyframes ping-halo {\n  0% {\n    transform: scale(1);\n    opacity: 0.6;\n  }\n  70% {\n    transform: scale(1.375, 1.43);\n    opacity: 0;\n  }\n  100% {\n    transform: scale(1.375, 1.43);\n    opacity: 0;\n  }\n}"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
